  <span class="eyebrow blue">Legal</span><h1>Terms of service</h1>
  <p class="lede">Replace this page with terms drafted for your jurisdiction before accepting a single live client.</p>
  <p>This scaffold ships with placeholder legal pages so the routes and navigation are complete. It is not legal text and must not be published as-is. At minimum your final terms should cover: eligibility and onboarding, client money handling, order execution, fees and spreads, withdrawal conditions and timeframes, account closure, dispute resolution, and the governing jurisdiction.</p>
